OL,3,GNEWSANew surfer creates winter meet-up
OL,4,Agroup
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who took up surfing five months
OL,7,Fago is now encouraging others to be
OL,8,Fbrave in the colder months after
OL,9,Ffalling in love with the sport just
OL,10,Fweeks before her 40th birthday.
OL,12,FVictoria Channing-Turner took a single
OL,13,Fsurfing lesson with her sister thinking
OL,14,Fnothing of it and it quickly became a
OL,15,Fpassion, leading her to create a new
OL,16,Fsocial surf group for people who want
OL,17,Fto stay active and meet new people over
OL,18,Fwinter.
OL,20,F"It just absolutely had me hooked," she
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
